or\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div><button class=\"icon-control grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-forest-950/15 text-forest-950 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-forest-700 hover:bg-forest-700 hover:text-white focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-4 focus-visible:ring-forest-600/15 lg:hidden\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main><section class=\"border-b border-white/10 bg-forest-950 text-white\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[90rem] px-5 py-20 lg:px-10 lg:py-28\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#d49a75]\">Tiffin Restaurant</p><h1 class=\"mt-5 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-bold leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.045em] sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl\">Made when you order it.</h1><p class=\"mt-7 max-w-2xl text-[17px] font-normal leading-8 text-forest-100/70\">The restaurant where our story began, serving breakfast, Nepali favourites, snacks and drinks every day.</p></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-[90rem] px-5 py-16 lg:px-10 lg:py-24\"><div class=\"grid border-y border-stone-300 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex gap-5 py-8 sm:border-r sm:border-stone-300 sm:pr-10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock-3 mt-1 shrink-0 text-[#a75536]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 6v6h4\"></path></svg><div><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-stone-500\">Restaurant hours</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] text-forest-950\">8:00 AM – 10:00 PM, daily</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-5 border-t border-stone-300 py-8 sm:border-t-0 sm:pl-10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-utensils-crossed lucide-fork-knife-crossed mt-1 shrink-0 text-[#a75536]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 2-2.3 2.3a3 3 0 0 0 0 4.2l1.8 1.8a3 3 0 0 0 4.2 0L22 8\"></path><path d=\"M15 15 3.3 3.3a4.2 4.2 0 0 0 0 6l7.3 7.3c.7.7 2 .7 2.8 0L15 15Zm0 0 7 7\"></path><path d=\"m2.1 21.8 6.4-6.3\"></path><path d=\"m19 5-7 7\"></path></svg><div><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-stone-500\">From our kitchen</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] text-forest-950\">Freshly prepared, family-run</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-[#f1e8d9]\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[90rem] px-5 py-20 lg:px-10 lg:py-28\"><div class=\"grid min-w-0 gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.62fr_1.38fr]\"><div class=\"lg:sticky lg:top-28 lg:self-start\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#a75536]\">The menu</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] text-forest-950 sm:text-5xl\">Food for mornings, long days and easy evenings.</h2><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-md text-base leading-8 text-stone-600\">These dishes and prices were transcribed from the owner-provided menu. Please confirm current availability when you visit.</p></div><div class=\"min-w-0 max-w-full overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"flex w-full max-w-full gap-7 overflow-x-auto border-b border-stone-300 [scrollbar-width:none]\"><button class=\"relative shrink-0 pb-4 text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-forest-900\">Breakfast<span class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-0.5 bg-[#b96343]\"></span></button><button class=\"relative shrink-0 pb-4 text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-stone-500 hover:text-forest-800\">Light bites</button><button class=\"relative shrink-0 pb-4 text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-stone-500 hover:text-forest-800\">Mains</button><button class=\"relative shrink-0 pb-4 text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-stone-500 hover:text-forest-800\">Veg snacks</button><button class=\"relative shrink-0 pb-4 text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-stone-500 hover:text-forest-800\">Non-veg snacks</button><button class=\"relative shrink-0 pb-4 text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-stone-500 hover:text-forest-800\">Soft drinks</button><button class=\"relative shrink-0 pb-4 text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-stone-500 hover:text-forest-800\">Bar</button></div><div class=\"py-10\" style=\"opacity:1;transform:none\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 border-b border-stone-300 pb-7 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between\"><div><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-forest-950\">Breakfast</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-stone-500\">Breakfast favourites, breads and eggs</p></div><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-stone-400\">Prices in NPR</p></div><div class=\"mt-2 grid gap-x-14 md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"border-b border-stone-200 py-5\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5\"><div><h3 class=\"text-[15px] font-medium text-stone-900\">Simple Breakfast</h3></div><span class=\"shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-forest-800\">395</span></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-stone-200 py-5\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5\"><div><h3 class=\"text-[15px] font-medium text-stone-900\">Heavy Breakfast</h3></div><span class=\"shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-forest-800\">695</span></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-stone-200 py-5\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5\"><div><h3 class=\"text-[15px] font-medium text-stone-900\">Plain Toast</h3></div><span class=\"shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-forest-800\">205</span></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-stone-200 py-5\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5\"><div><h3 class=\"text-[15px] font-medium text-stone-900\">J / B / H Toast</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-stone-400\">Jam, butter or honey</p></div><span class=\"shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-forest-800\">305</span></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-stone-200 py-5\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5\"><div><h3 class=\"text-[15px] font-medium text-stone-900\">Tibetan Bread</h3></div><span class=\"shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-forest-800\">300</span></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-stone-200 py-5\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5\"><div><h3 class=\"text-[15px] font-medium text-stone-900\">Garlic Bread</h3></div><span class=\"shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-forest-800\">295</span></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-stone-200 py-5\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5\"><div><h3 class=\"text-[15px] font-medium text-stone-900\">French Toast</h3></div><span class=\"shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-forest-800\">400</span></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-stone-200 py-5\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5\"><div><h3 class=\"text-[15px] font-medium text-stone-900\">Grilled Cheese Toast</h3></div><span class=\"shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-forest-800\">500</span></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-stone-200 py-5\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5\"><div><h3 class=\"text-[15px] font-medium text-stone-900\">Egg</h3></div><span class=\"shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-forest-800\">105</span></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-stone-200 py-5\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5\"><div><h3 class=\"text-[15px] font-medium text-stone-900\">Boiled Egg</h3></div><span class=\"shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-forest-800\">195</span></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-stone-200 py-5\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5\"><div><h3 class=\"text-[15px] font-medium text-stone-900\">Fried Egg</h3></div><span class=\"shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-forest-800\">200</span></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-stone-200 py-5\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5\"><div><h3 class=\"text-[15px] font-medium text-stone-900\">Masala Egg</h3></div><span class=\"shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-forest-800\">250</span></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-stone-200 py-5\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5\"><div><h3 class=\"text-[15px] font-medium text-stone-900\">Poached Egg</h3></div><span class=\"shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-forest-800\">250</span></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-stone-200 py-5\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5\"><div><h3 class=\"text-[15px] font-medium text-stone-900\">Scrambled Egg</h3></div><span class=\"shrink-0 text-xs text-stone-400\">Ask us</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-[90rem] px-5 py-20 lg:px-10\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-6 border-y border-stone-300 py-10 sm:flex-row sm:items-center\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#a75536]\">Planning a meal?</p><h2 class=\"mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.035em] text-forest-950\">Call the restaurant before you visit.</h2></div><a href=\"tel:9845160919\" class=\"border-b border-forest-700 pb-1 text-lg font-semibold text-forest-800\">9845160919</a></div></section><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Restaurant\",\"name\":\"Tiffin Home & Restaurant\",\"openingHou